{"sections":{"breadcrumbs_Gxg9wp":{"type":"breadcrumbs","settings":{"text_alignment":"center"}},"rich_text_tDmPrz":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"subheading_qWaFJ9":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"subheading":"PERSONALISED LASER HAIR REMOVAL SOLUTIONS"}},"heading_tUzpAx":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Facials for Radiant Skin: The Deluxe Difference","heading_size":"h1","heading_highlight_style":"none"}},"text_LTmyFe":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Looking for a facial treatment that genuinely refreshes your skin, without draining your bank account? At Deluxe, we bring together renowned skincare brands like Dr Grandel, QMS Medicosmetics, and Environ. We use LED light therapy, gentle peels, and deep-cleansing techniques. This helps to brighten, smooth, and soothe your skin in one relaxing session.<br\/><br\/>Our skincare experts can analyse your treatment. We will personalise it to meet your skincare needs. Visit any Deluxe Laser & Aesthetics location if you're unsure about what your skin needs. Our skincare experts will give you a free face scan. They will provide a personalised treatment and product plan just for you.<br\/><br\/>Reserve your spot online, collect loyalty points, and we’ll call to confirm a time that fits your schedule. Whether you want a quick glow-up or a deeper treatment, our menu helps you get healthy, radiant skin easily.<br\/><\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["subheading_qWaFJ9","heading_tUzpAx","text_LTmyFe"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":70,"padding_bottom":70,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"banner":{"type":"main-collection-banner","blocks":{"collection_info_zUNyKV":{"type":"collection_info","settings":{"heading_size":"hd2","heading_tag":"h1","show_description":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}}},"block_order":["collection_info_zUNyKV"],"disabled":true,"